// Arenas, ported from benilla-app's survivors/data.rs. `map` is the Map.dbc id (0 Eastern Kingdoms,
// 1 Kalimdor); `center` is in WoW coordinates (x, y, z); `leash` is how far heroes may roam;
// `enemies` are weakest first; `boss` is the enemy key of the boss who comes every four minutes.
// `shrines_at_once` is how many shrines, chests and banners stand at once (new ones come as old
// ones are used); `pots` how many pots stand scattered over the arena; `elite_camps` how many
// camps an elite guards (a new one comes some minutes after it dies); `interactables` are the
// kinds that can come, each with how many may stand at once and how often it comes up (`weight`).
// Only zones whose terrain is in the game data can be played. The "boss candidates" comments
// are the original game's bosses (display, level, speed, scale), not all in the data.
